3Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E上班為了生活，放假就去旅行。Work hard 完就Play hard, Play hard 完再Work hard。這個真是工作的意義嗎？帆書app創辦人樊登曾經對工作產生懷疑，陷入迷惘、沮喪。後來經過閱讀和思考，領悟到工作的價值和意義，寫下了他的經典代表作《工作的本質》，提出一套5階段的工作成長法，讓工作成為人生的一場修煉。\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E歡迎大家參與新一期讀書會，6月7日見\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.xx.fbcdn.net\u002Fimages\u002Femoji.php\u002Fv9\u002Ftf6\u002F2\u002F16\u002F1f609.png\" alt=\"😉\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fstatic.xx.fbcdn.net\u002Fimages\u002Femoji.php\u002Fv9\u002Ft38\u002F2\u002F16\u002F1fa77.png\" alt=\"🩷\"\u003E\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(8,8,9);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif;\"\u003E記得同我地報名啊！\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","2025-06-07",null,"reading_club_250607","讀書會","2025-09-14T07:22:29.744Z",{"data":11},[12],{"id":13,"attributes":14},1,{"name":8,"slug":15,"description":6,"createdAt":16,"updatedAt":16},"book-sharing","2023-02-12T02:38:55.939Z",{"data":18},{"id":19,"attributes":20},71,{"name":21,"alternativeText":6,"caption":6,"width":22,"height":23,"formats":24,"hash":55,"ext":26,"mime":29,"size":56,"url":57,"previewUrl":6,"provider":58,"provider_metadata":6,"createdAt":59,"updatedAt":59},"500700831_1111297777697923_4085221122447372634_n.j